72
00:09:21.496 --> 00:09:24.090
They give you food
and cable and weed.

73
00:09:24.296 --> 00:09:25.695
Oh. please.

74
00:09:25.936 --> 00:09:30.487
But you have to let him suck you
on your neck whenever he wants.

75
00:09:30.696 --> 00:09:33.733
- Doesn't sound too bad.
- Done worse.

76
00:09:33.936 --> 00:09:35.733
- L'll say.
- This way. girls.

77
00:09:48.736 --> 00:09:51.250
So this is Lestat's house?

78
00:09:51.456 --> 00:09:54.653
lt is this week. We move around a lot.

79
00:09:54.896 --> 00:09:56.295
Why is that?

80
00:09:56.976 --> 00:10:00.093
What can l say? The guy is just... .

81
00:10:01.616 --> 00:10:06.929
- Boss. L didn't see you there.
- No. You wouldn't. would you?

82
00:10:10.336 --> 00:10:13.612
These are the girls
that you asked for.

83
00:10:14.296 --> 00:10:15.775
Yes.

84
00:10:30.816 --> 00:10:33.853
Do you want me to take
the girls home later?

85
00:10:34.056 --> 00:10:36.126
No. thank you. Roger.

86
00:10:36.336 --> 00:10:38.930
l'll make sure they're taken care of.

87
00:10:41.536 --> 00:10:43.492
You want some?

88
00:10:44.456 --> 00:10:46.367
Want me?

89
00:10:47.376 --> 00:10:49.048
You hungry?

90
00:10:53.096 --> 00:10:56.452
You hungry for something else?

91
00:11:00.456 --> 00:11:02.174
Come on.

92
00:11:02.616 --> 00:11:05.972
- Don't you want to have some fun?
- Don't do that.

93
00:11:06.256 --> 00:11:08.486
Are you ticklish?

94
00:11:08.696 --> 00:11:11.256
l'm very ticklish.

95
00:12:14.616 --> 00:12:16.686
Come out. come out...

96
00:12:16.936 --> 00:12:19.245
...whoever you are.

97
00:12:27.136 --> 00:12:28.774
<i>Jesse. </i>

98
00:12:30.536 --> 00:12:33.573
<i>Jesse. </i>

99
00:12:33.776 --> 00:12:35.255
<i>A voice... </i>

100
00:12:36.176 --> 00:12:38.212
<i>... calling to me... </i>

101
00:12:38.416 --> 00:12:40.407
<i>... in my dreams. </i>

102
00:12:40.616 --> 00:12:44.131
<i>The same dream I've had</i>
<i>since I was 6.</i>

103
00:12:44.536 --> 00:12:47.255
<i>I have a family of my own. </i>

104
00:12:47.576 --> 00:12:50.136
<i>Not a strange dream. really. </i>

105
00:12:50.336 --> 00:12:52.930
<i>One every orphan has. </i>

106
00:13:19.576 --> 00:13:21.328
l'm sorry. but you must go.

107
00:13:21.536 --> 00:13:25.165
Why can't l stay with you?
Please. Aunt Maharet.

108
00:13:25.376 --> 00:13:28.686
l don't want you to go. But you must.

109
00:13:29.136 --> 00:13:31.855
Aunt. you're bleeding.

110
00:13:38.296 --> 00:13:40.173
You must be with your own.

111
00:13:40.376 --> 00:13:44.892
- <i>I knew things were not normal. </i>
- This isn't the life l wanted for you.

112
00:13:45.096 --> 00:13:49.009
<i>I only knew I was part of them. </i>
<i>and being cast out. </i>

113
00:13:49.216 --> 00:13:50.410
<i>Was I bad? </i>

114
00:13:50.616 --> 00:13:52.652
