115
00:13:52.856 --> 00:13:55.211
l'll always be watching over you.

116
00:13:55.416 --> 00:13:57.771
l want to stay with you forever.

117
00:13:58.016 --> 00:14:00.405
You can't.

118
00:14:34.736 --> 00:14:36.852
<i>I'm Serena Altschul. MTV News. </i>

119
00:14:37.056 --> 00:14:41.766
<i>Vampire turned rocker Lestat</i>
